From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sunshineinabox <aqemail@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 02:10:00 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] clk: qcom: gpucc-sm6115: fix the GDSC settings and park the
 GFX3D RCG at XO

The SM6115 GPU CX and GX GDSCs sit at the same registers as the QCM2290
ones (0x599106c and 0x599100c in both vendor trees), and get the fixes
Qualcomm made for QCM2290 in v7.3:

 08cfbfd81dd6 clk: qcom: qcm2290: Update DISPCC and GPUCC GDSC *wait_val values
 6b0044bc75b0 clk: qcom: qcm2290: Set POLL_CFG_GDSCR flag for DISPCC and GPUCC GDSCs
 899dfd90229e clk: qcom: qcm2290: Add RETAIN_FF_ENABLE flag for DISPCC and GPUCC GDSCs
 ab46b5fb668b clk: qcom: gpucc-qcm2290: Park RCG's clk source at XO during disable

Wait values 0x2/0x2/0x2, the hardware defaults, except the CX clock
disable wait: the vendor bengal kernel programs 8 there
(qcom,clk-dis-wait-val in bengal-gdsc.dtsi), and that is kept.
POLL_CFG_GDSCR on GX only; CX reports through gds_hw_ctrl.
RETAIN_FF_ENABLE on both. The GFX3D RCG uses the shared ops, so it is
parked at XO while disabled, as the hardware team asks for QCM2290.

Kept as SM6115 has them: VOTABLE on GX (QCM2290's GX has none), and no
AON_RESET (vendor scuba resets the GX AON logic, vendor bengal does not).

Not posted. Not HW-tested.

Signed-off-by: sunshineinabox <aqemail@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/clk/qcom/gpucc-sm6115.c | 12 +++++++++---
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/clk/qcom/gpucc-sm6115.c b/drivers/clk/qcom/gpucc-sm6115.c
index 08f2635b0c20..7ef1e7604d58 100644
--- a/drivers/clk/qcom/gpucc-sm6115.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/qcom/gpucc-sm6115.c
@@ -230,7 +230,7 @@ static struct clk_rcg2 gpu_cc_gx_gfx3d_clk_src = {
 		.parent_data = gpu_cc_parent_data_1,
 		.num_parents = ARRAY_SIZE(gpu_cc_parent_data_1),
 		.flags = CLK_SET_RATE_PARENT | CLK_OPS_PARENT_ENABLE,
-		.ops = &clk_rcg2_ops,
+		.ops = &clk_rcg2_shared_ops,
 	},
 };
 
@@ -397,11 +397,14 @@ static struct clk_branch gpu_cc_hlos1_vote_gpu_smmu_clk = {
 static struct gdsc gpu_cx_gdsc = {
 	.gdscr = 0x106c,
 	.gds_hw_ctrl = 0x1540,
+	.en_rest_wait_val = 0x2,
+	.en_few_wait_val = 0x2,
+	.clk_dis_wait_val = 0x8,
 	.pd = {
 		.name = "gpu_cx_gdsc",
 	},
 	.pwrsts = PWRSTS_OFF_ON,
-	.flags = VOTABLE,
+	.flags = RETAIN_FF_ENABLE | VOTABLE,
 };
 
 static struct gdsc gpu_gx_gdsc = {
@@ -409,12 +412,15 @@ static struct gdsc gpu_gx_gdsc = {
 	.clamp_io_ctrl = 0x1508,
 	.resets = (unsigned int []){ GPU_GX_BCR },
 	.reset_count = 1,
+	.en_rest_wait_val = 0x2,
+	.en_few_wait_val = 0x2,
+	.clk_dis_wait_val = 0x2,
 	.pd = {
 		.name = "gpu_gx_gdsc",
 	},
 	.parent = &gpu_cx_gdsc.pd,
 	.pwrsts = PWRSTS_OFF_ON,
-	.flags = CLAMP_IO | SW_RESET | VOTABLE,
+	.flags = RETAIN_FF_ENABLE | POLL_CFG_GDSCR | CLAMP_IO | SW_RESET | VOTABLE,
 };
 
 static struct clk_regmap *gpu_cc_sm6115_clocks[] = {
-- 
2.47.0

